WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.595
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.865 --> 01:43.905
Weird.

3
01:45.225 --> 01:46.345
Very weird.

4
01:47.385 --> 01:50.425
Zheng Yu suddenly borrowed an outfit from Fangli.

5
01:50.505 --> 01:51.785
She's up to no good.

6
01:52.585 --> 01:56.185
Did that ruse from this afternoon work?

7
01:56.265 --> 01:58.985
They hit it off and are going on a date.

8
01:59.065 --> 02:01.785
That proves Fangli is an expert at this.

9
02:04.985 --> 02:05.825
What's wrong?

10
02:06.465 --> 02:08.225
I chose the wrong outfit.

11
02:08.304 --> 02:09.864
That outfit today

12
02:09.945 --> 02:11.665
didn't show my full potential.

13
02:30.745 --> 02:32.345
I forgot to ask.

14
02:32.425 --> 02:35.305
How did you two meet in the first place?

15
02:36.305 --> 02:39.985
All of Xiaomian's customers are students in his grade.

16
02:40.065 --> 02:42.665
You're not in the same grade. How did you meet?

17
02:43.385 --> 02:46.425
I chose him at first glance from a sea of people.

18
02:50.785 --> 02:52.225
You chose him based on looks?

19
02:53.465 --> 02:56.105
There's nothing interesting about this ordinary face.

20
02:57.985 --> 02:59.345
You called me good-looking.

21
03:00.025 --> 03:00.985
Twice.

22
03:04.185 --> 03:06.825
It was a jab at you for pretending to be cool.

23
03:06.905 --> 03:08.665
Couldn't you even tell?

24
03:11.345 --> 03:13.745
When I arrived at the school today,

25
03:13.825 --> 03:15.585
I think someone said,

26
03:16.665 --> 03:17.985
"Although he's good-looking,

27
03:18.065 --> 03:19.825
from my observations,

28
03:19.905 --> 03:22.505
dating him would be quite boring."

29
03:23.105 --> 03:24.185
Shut up!

30
03:24.265 --> 03:25.105
Dating?

31
03:26.105 --> 03:27.065
How old are you?

32
03:27.865 --> 03:29.545
The point is the latter part.

33
03:29.625 --> 03:31.065
"Boring."

34
03:31.145 --> 03:32.025
Get it?

35
03:33.705 --> 03:35.185
Should you even consider it?

36
03:35.265 --> 03:37.025
You shut up too.

37
03:40.465 --> 03:41.305
Are you laughing?

38
03:41.385 --> 03:42.945
Does being my rumored boyfriend

39
03:43.025 --> 03:44.025
make you happy?

40
04:03.985 --> 04:04.825
Who ordered beer?

41
04:06.585 --> 04:07.745
I did.

42
04:09.665 --> 04:10.825
You're out of control.

43
04:11.865 --> 04:14.185
You said Ms. Zheng was going to be naughty.

44
04:14.825 --> 04:15.825
She can't leave now.

45
04:18.225 --> 04:19.504
Besides,

46
04:19.585 --> 04:20.985
alcohol reveals the truth.

47
04:21.064 --> 04:23.585
Since you two saved my life today,

48
04:25.425 --> 04:26.745
I've done what I can.

49
04:26.825 --> 04:28.145
I have something to say.

50
04:35.425 --> 04:39.585
Chen Yanzhou.

51
04:42.105 --> 04:44.825
Your outfit today

52
04:46.505 --> 04:48.025
looks sharp.

53
05:45.545 --> 05:48.585
Your sister really can't hold her alcohol.

54
05:49.705 --> 05:51.585
I'll take her back to campus first.

55
05:53.105 --> 05:55.265
-Where are you going? -With my sister.

56
05:55.985 --> 05:58.105
And then? You'll make my cousin take you home?

57
05:58.705 --> 05:59.905
No.

58
06:03.185 --> 06:04.905
How are you two getting home?

59
06:04.985 --> 06:06.785
-He said he'll take me. -I didn't.

60
06:06.865 --> 06:08.225
You did.

61
06:09.105 --> 06:11.905
I heard it.

62
06:11.985 --> 06:14.185
Message me when you get home.

63
06:14.265 --> 06:15.105
And you.

64
06:15.185 --> 06:17.745
You memorized my number. Don't forget to message me.

65
06:25.025 --> 06:26.505
Be careful.

66
06:36.705 --> 06:37.545
Jiang Mian!

67
06:39.025 --> 06:39.865
Jiang Mian.

68
06:40.465 --> 06:41.545
Jiang Mian.

69
06:42.105 --> 06:43.065
Jiang Mian.

70
06:43.145 --> 06:45.145
Can you stop saying my name?

71
06:45.225 --> 06:47.945
Ms. Zheng's mom is surnamed Jiang.

72
06:48.025 --> 06:50.905
But Jiang Mian wasn't born with his mother's surname.

73
06:50.985 --> 06:53.465
It's because he was adopted by his uncle.

74
06:53.545 --> 06:55.865
Then what do I call you, if not your name?

75
06:56.945 --> 06:57.905
Smarty?

76
06:57.985 --> 06:59.225
Hottie?

77
06:59.305 --> 07:00.145
Mian?

78
07:01.305 --> 07:02.865
Or…

79
07:02.945 --> 07:04.305
Xiaomian?

80
07:07.985 --> 07:11.265
Xiaomian, why are you walking so fast? Do you know where I live?

81
07:11.345 --> 07:14.225
I never agreed to see you home.

82
07:14.825 --> 07:16.985
I wouldn't trust you to.

83
07:17.065 --> 07:19.305
After all, there isn't an adult at home.

84
07:19.385 --> 07:22.185
I would be helpless against you if you made a move on me.

85
07:23.745 --> 07:24.985
Stop playing the victim.

86
07:25.785 --> 07:27.705
Because we're the same.

87
07:27.785 --> 07:29.425
My mom

88
07:31.105 --> 07:32.625
also can't come to school.

89
07:33.265 --> 07:35.185
And my dad has passed away too.

90
07:36.745 --> 07:37.585
"Too"?

91
07:38.945 --> 07:41.785
Didn't you tell the teacher that your dad died long ago?

92
07:43.745 --> 07:45.625
Yes, right, he's not here.

93
07:47.065 --> 07:48.305
You lied?

94
07:49.585 --> 07:52.785
A dad who cheated and remarried is no different from being dead.

95
08:00.345 --> 08:01.425
Lead the way.

96
08:10.425 --> 08:13.105
We missed the doors closing by ten minutes.

97
08:15.985 --> 08:18.585
Chen Yanzhou, stand straighter.

98
08:19.745 --> 08:21.265
You're so handsome today.

99
08:22.105 --> 08:23.585
Don't hunch over.

100
08:25.505 --> 08:26.425
You're drunk.

101
08:28.305 --> 08:29.185
I'm not drunk.

102
08:33.144 --> 08:35.185
Stand straighter.

103
08:54.025 --> 08:56.345
Am I standing straighter now?

104
08:59.345 --> 09:01.785
This is good for your spine.

105
09:04.665 --> 09:07.185
Since I'm so obedient today,

106
09:07.265 --> 09:08.625
can you lend me your phone?

107
09:21.105 --> 09:22.145
Why do you want it?

108
09:23.505 --> 09:24.545
The doors are closed.

109
09:24.625 --> 09:28.305
I'll ask your roommates to ask the dorm manager to open the door.

110
09:29.265 --> 09:30.465
We can't let the dorm manager

111
09:30.545 --> 09:33.625
see you drunk and escorted back by a boy.

112
09:36.825 --> 09:37.945
No way.

113
09:38.025 --> 09:40.305
If the dorm manager opens the door,

114
09:40.385 --> 09:42.545
I'll have points deducted.

115
09:42.625 --> 09:44.825
I have to get my prize money.

116
09:44.905 --> 09:47.985
I have to make a lot, a lot, a lot of money.

117
09:48.865 --> 09:50.185
That won't do.

118
09:51.385 --> 09:52.825
Then I'll take you…

119
09:53.625 --> 09:54.465
to a hotel?

120
09:55.385 --> 09:56.785
Do you have your ID?

121
10:02.865 --> 10:03.705
Chen Yanzhou,

122
10:03.785 --> 10:05.785
I can sleep on the street.

123
10:05.865 --> 10:06.705
I…

124
10:06.785 --> 10:08.105
I'll find a nice spot.

125
10:08.185 --> 10:09.385
A nice spot. Here.

126
10:17.545 --> 10:20.025
There's another place. Want to go?

127
10:25.465 --> 10:26.305
Then let's go.

128
10:42.705 --> 10:44.385
I can't walk anymore.

129
10:59.585 --> 11:00.505
Why

130
11:01.145 --> 11:02.505
are you looking at me?

131
11:05.825 --> 11:07.665
Now you're quiet.

132
11:09.065 --> 11:10.625
Chen Yanzhou.

133
11:12.505 --> 11:15.385
Why have you been mad at me for the past few days?

134
11:16.785 --> 11:17.825
I haven't been.

135
11:17.905 --> 11:19.625
You have.

136
11:19.705 --> 11:21.625
You weren't like this before.

137
11:22.225 --> 11:23.465
Tell me.

138
11:23.545 --> 11:25.585
Tell me the reason

139
11:25.665 --> 11:27.745
so I'll know how to sweet-talk you.

140
11:28.865 --> 11:29.985
Sweet-talk me?

141
11:32.825 --> 11:34.065
Sweet-talk you.

142
11:37.185 --> 11:41.305
Yesterday, you went out for lunch with Duan Shengyang.

143
11:42.065 --> 11:44.665
What were you talking so happily about?

144
11:45.745 --> 11:47.905
Shoot, I can't tell you.

145
11:48.745 --> 11:50.785
Someone said she wanted to sweet-talk me.

146
11:50.865 --> 11:52.865
I guess she was just kidding.

147
11:52.945 --> 11:54.785
No.

148
11:54.865 --> 11:56.425
Actually, that meal

149
11:57.025 --> 11:59.825
wasn't enjoyable for me at all.

150
11:59.905 --> 12:02.385
Liar. I saw you.

151
12:02.465 --> 12:04.145
It's true.

152
12:04.905 --> 12:06.225
Fine.

153
12:06.305 --> 12:07.985
Then tell me.

154
12:08.065 --> 12:10.225
How did Duan Shengyang make you unhappy?

155
12:12.105 --> 12:13.865
It doesn't have to do with him.

156
12:13.945 --> 12:15.305
It's your fault.

157
12:16.185 --> 12:17.265
Me?

158
12:18.905 --> 12:20.705
Because that meal

159
12:20.785 --> 12:23.185
made me realize something I didn't know before.

160
12:23.825 --> 12:25.025
What?

161
12:26.425 --> 12:27.705
I realized

162
12:27.785 --> 12:29.745
that because of you,

163
12:29.825 --> 12:31.705
I started to have expectations.

164
12:36.465 --> 12:37.785
Expectations?

165
12:39.185 --> 12:40.785
The expectation

166
12:40.865 --> 12:42.665
that I, too, can have a future.

167
12:43.665 --> 12:45.665
A wonderful future.

168
12:46.545 --> 12:49.665
So shouldn't I blame you?

169
12:49.745 --> 12:51.585
I'm not even angry with you.

170
12:52.345 --> 12:54.585
But you're angry with me.

171
13:04.025 --> 13:04.865
Zheng Yu.

172
13:05.585 --> 13:06.945
You…

173
13:08.105 --> 13:09.545
Lift your head first.

174
13:18.785 --> 13:19.945
Zheng Yu.

175
13:39.345 --> 13:41.025
Why do you look so serious?

176
13:41.825 --> 13:42.905
Tell me.

177
13:42.985 --> 13:44.785
How should I sweet-talk you

178
13:44.865 --> 13:46.865
to make you smile?

179
13:48.985 --> 13:50.265
I don't know.

180
13:50.345 --> 13:52.785
Why don't you figure it out?

181
15:44.545 --> 15:46.945
Zheng Yu, are you awake?

182
15:47.545 --> 15:49.065
Can I come in?

183
15:56.225 --> 15:58.825
What's wrong with your neck?

184
16:00.065 --> 16:01.305
Nothing.

185
16:01.385 --> 16:02.465
I must have slept wrong.

186
16:05.505 --> 16:06.545
Last night, you--

187
16:06.625 --> 16:08.345
I drank too much last night.

188
16:08.425 --> 16:11.185
I only remember Gao Xing mentioning a rumored boyfriend.

189
16:12.345 --> 16:13.625
That was hilarious.

190
16:14.425 --> 16:18.065
I… And then I don't remember much.

191
16:20.505 --> 16:21.505
Right.

192
16:21.585 --> 16:25.105
Where did you get that perfume on your desk?

193
16:27.105 --> 16:29.425
I saw it on your Moments and bought it.

194
16:31.265 --> 16:35.185
So the buyer who chatted with me

195
16:35.265 --> 16:36.225
was you.

196
16:43.705 --> 16:46.065
Speaking of which, I have a complaint.

197
16:46.145 --> 16:48.545
Your perfume doesn't match the description.

198
16:49.745 --> 16:51.905
I specified that it had a flaw.

199
16:51.985 --> 16:53.705
Is the scratch too obvious?

200
16:53.785 --> 16:55.145
Why don't you…

201
17:00.185 --> 17:02.305
This isn't how you described the scent.

202
17:19.944 --> 17:21.905
You have to inhale to smell it.

203
17:31.225 --> 17:32.745
I told you.

204
17:32.825 --> 17:34.785
I found the description online.

205
17:34.865 --> 17:36.785
I didn't know it would be so off.

206
17:40.905 --> 17:43.385
Tell me how you want to settle this.

207
17:47.305 --> 17:49.665
Have a meal with me. Consider it compensation.

208
17:57.305 --> 18:00.985
Seller, this isn't the right attitude for solving issues.

209
18:07.545 --> 18:09.385
Do your parents know

210
18:09.465 --> 18:11.065
that I stayed overnight?

211
18:11.785 --> 18:13.465
If I walk out like this,

212
18:13.545 --> 18:15.065
won't it be a bit awkward?

213
18:15.825 --> 18:19.465
Why don't I wait for them to leave

214
18:19.545 --> 18:20.665
before I come out?

215
18:22.665 --> 18:25.585
What if my parents stay in all day?

216
18:25.665 --> 18:27.745
Will you camp out in this room?

217
18:29.945 --> 18:32.025
-Dad! Mom! -Don't.

218
18:40.305 --> 18:41.465
No one is here.

219
18:43.665 --> 18:46.345
They've gone to my grandma's house for a few days.

220
18:52.985 --> 18:55.905
By the way, there are new toiletries in the bathroom.

221
18:55.985 --> 18:57.425
I'll wait for you downstairs.

222
19:05.585 --> 19:06.865
Is it bad?

223
19:13.385 --> 19:14.225
I know a method.

224
19:14.825 --> 19:15.945
Try it.

225
19:17.825 --> 19:20.585
This acupoint here is called the Stiff Neck acupoint.

226
19:20.665 --> 19:22.465
Massage it for a minute or two.

227
19:23.905 --> 19:24.745
Turn your neck.

228
19:29.705 --> 19:30.705
No.

229
19:30.785 --> 19:33.225
Turn your head to the side that is stiff.

230
19:37.705 --> 19:39.505
Why is the door open?

231
19:39.585 --> 19:40.425
Right.

232
19:47.385 --> 19:49.545
Mr. and Mrs. Chen.

233
19:49.625 --> 19:51.225
Dad, Mom.

234
19:56.025 --> 19:58.225
I think I'm fine now.

235
19:59.505 --> 20:01.185
Sir, ma'am,

236
20:01.265 --> 20:02.425
I have to go now.

237
20:02.505 --> 20:04.065
Bye.

238
20:06.425 --> 20:08.905
Stay for a meal, Ms. Xiaozheng.

239
20:09.705 --> 20:11.785
Look, I bought so many groceries.

240
20:12.745 --> 20:14.545
No, thank you. I…

241
20:14.625 --> 20:16.265
You helped fix my phone.

242
20:16.345 --> 20:19.385
If you leave without eating, I will feel bad.

243
20:19.465 --> 20:20.585
Let's do that.

244
20:26.465 --> 20:28.345
Then I'll go help.

245
20:48.145 --> 20:49.385
-This-- -Dad.

246
20:49.465 --> 20:52.545
Why are you two back so early?

247
20:54.945 --> 20:57.945
You know your grandma's temper.

248
20:58.025 --> 21:00.505
Your mom and I couldn't stand it after one night.

249
21:00.585 --> 21:03.265
We left quickly after breakfast.

250
21:07.265 --> 21:08.305
Oh, right.

251
21:08.385 --> 21:11.145
These are freshly-picked mangoes.

252
21:11.745 --> 21:14.065
They're not in stores at this time of year.

253
21:14.145 --> 21:16.785
Pack some for her to take home.

254
21:17.945 --> 21:18.785
Okay.

255
21:25.585 --> 21:27.105
Ma'am, these are washed.

256
21:27.185 --> 21:28.465
What else can I help with?

257
21:30.185 --> 21:31.385
Whip the eggs for me.

258
21:40.945 --> 21:42.305
What's wrong?

259
21:42.385 --> 21:43.785
Do you not like to eat eggs?

260
21:44.465 --> 21:45.745
It's not that.

261
21:45.825 --> 21:47.785
I just remembered something.

262
21:47.865 --> 21:49.625
I learned only recently

263
21:49.705 --> 21:52.705
that some people are allergic to eggs.

264
21:53.745 --> 21:56.065
Are there people who are allergic to eggs?

265
21:58.025 --> 22:00.865
Especially people who have been seriously ill.

266
22:01.465 --> 22:03.425
They may seem to have recovered,

267
22:03.505 --> 22:05.825
but their bodies have weakened immunity

268
22:05.905 --> 22:07.465
and develop new allergies.

269
22:09.705 --> 22:11.425
Then they should be careful.

270
22:12.545 --> 22:15.665
After a serious illness, you never know

271
22:15.745 --> 22:17.905
what long-term effects there might be.

272
22:25.865 --> 22:26.745
Here.

273
22:32.185 --> 22:36.345
Last time, when I came here to drop off the mock exam, I ate this here.

274
22:37.025 --> 22:38.225
It tastes very special,

275
22:38.305 --> 22:39.905
so it has been on my mind.

276
22:39.985 --> 22:41.105
Is that so?

277
22:41.185 --> 22:42.465
Yes.

278
22:42.545 --> 22:45.065
A simple dish like this

279
22:45.145 --> 22:47.385
really tests a chef's skills.

280
22:48.305 --> 22:49.585
You sure like to brag.

281
22:49.665 --> 22:53.185
Xiaozheng, if you like it, come over when you're free.

282
22:53.785 --> 22:55.105
My wife is often at home.

283
22:55.185 --> 22:56.865
It's just another place setting.

284
22:57.465 --> 22:59.105
I'm often not at home.

285
23:03.825 --> 23:05.425
I mean

286
23:05.505 --> 23:07.505
that our volunteer group

287
23:07.585 --> 23:08.865
has been very busy lately.

288
23:10.425 --> 23:12.705
I'm often not at home, so…

289
23:13.825 --> 23:16.065
Today's situation won't happen again.

290
23:18.945 --> 23:22.665
Mom, she missed her dorm curfew yesterday, so she stayed the night.

291
23:23.785 --> 23:25.065
It's not what you think.

292
23:33.825 --> 23:34.945
She even stayed over?

293
23:52.905 --> 23:54.945
Don't mind what my parents said.

294
23:55.025 --> 23:57.065
We didn't have many options yesterday.

295
23:58.665 --> 23:59.945
Do you remember what you--

296
24:00.025 --> 24:02.465
Things ended very late yesterday.

297
24:02.545 --> 24:03.905
I must've been locked out.

298
24:03.985 --> 24:07.745
I'm already very grateful that you let me stay over.

299
24:09.065 --> 24:12.025
That's easy for you to say. You've forgotten what you did.

300
24:16.985 --> 24:19.185
Your parents seem very sweet together.

301
24:19.265 --> 24:22.185
When we left, your dad even told me

302
24:22.265 --> 24:24.185
that your mom loves to eat mangoes.

303
24:24.265 --> 24:28.505
But the juice gets all over her hands, so she doesn't want to bother.

304
24:28.585 --> 24:31.105
He always cuts them up for her.

305
24:32.665 --> 24:34.345
Yes, they are very close.

306
24:40.705 --> 24:42.705
I cut up some mango.

307
24:42.785 --> 24:44.265
Try it.

308
24:48.265 --> 24:50.425
They're far away by now.

309
24:52.185 --> 24:53.025
Still looking?

310
24:54.065 --> 24:55.705
I just realized today.

311
24:55.785 --> 24:58.905
Even Yanzhou is old enough to date now.

312
24:58.985 --> 25:00.465
Time sure flies.

313
25:01.945 --> 25:04.105
Dating? What dating?

314
25:04.185 --> 25:05.745
Far from it.

315
25:05.825 --> 25:07.945
From what I see, your son's romance

316
25:08.025 --> 25:10.465
is like these mangoes that can't be sold yet.

317
25:10.545 --> 25:12.105
Astringent.

318
25:12.185 --> 25:13.705
It's not ripe yet.

319
25:25.745 --> 25:28.185
It's only 8:00 a.m. Am I seeing things?

320
25:31.825 --> 25:34.905
No, you aren't. I plan to turn over a new leaf.

321
25:35.585 --> 25:36.745
Didn't you say

322
25:36.825 --> 25:40.265
to get rid of those ridiculous thoughts and work properly?

323
25:44.105 --> 25:46.105
Hey, don't look at me like that.

324
25:46.185 --> 25:48.145
I'm serious. I even made preparations.

325
25:48.825 --> 25:49.665
Like what?

326
25:54.225 --> 25:56.025
Vitamins.

327
25:56.105 --> 25:57.825
Liver support tablets.

328
25:57.905 --> 25:59.625
Fast-acting heart-soothing pills.

329
26:01.465 --> 26:02.625
Agarose. No, not this.

330
26:03.745 --> 26:04.945
There's more.

331
26:06.185 --> 26:07.945
No, don't be impatient.

332
26:08.025 --> 26:10.105
There's more. Come.

333
26:11.945 --> 26:13.105
Over here.

334
26:19.865 --> 26:20.745
I'm surprised.

335
26:21.385 --> 26:22.625
You're good at drawing.

336
26:23.505 --> 26:25.585
Skills honed in the zoology lab class.

337
26:26.465 --> 26:27.705
What do you think?

338
26:29.545 --> 26:30.425
I have a question.

339
26:31.025 --> 26:32.025
Shoot.

340
26:32.105 --> 26:33.065
Why

341
26:33.145 --> 26:34.585
are you in the middle?

342
26:36.305 --> 26:37.545
I have an announcement.

343
26:38.225 --> 26:40.825
The boss's birthday party is next Sunday evening.

344
26:40.905 --> 26:42.185
I'll send you the address.

345
26:43.025 --> 26:44.265
Midway through dinner,

346
26:44.345 --> 26:46.065
will he check on our progress?

347
26:46.145 --> 26:47.665
I'll pretend to be drunk.

348
26:47.745 --> 26:49.425
-I'm not done yet. -Zero progress.

349
26:49.505 --> 26:50.705
-Zheng Yu. -Don't ask me.

350
26:50.785 --> 26:52.185
And there's this.

351
27:04.385 --> 27:05.985
A birthday gift?

352
27:06.065 --> 27:08.065
Yes. We discussed it.

353
27:08.145 --> 27:10.905
One from the PhD students.

354
27:10.985 --> 27:12.545
One from the master's students.

355
27:13.305 --> 27:14.665
Do you guys also…?

356
27:16.065 --> 27:18.865
It doesn't have to be expensive. He won't accept it then.

357
27:18.945 --> 27:21.745
It's been like that every year. Just a small token.

358
27:21.825 --> 27:23.585
I might not be free on Sunday.

359
27:24.625 --> 27:27.265
It won't take long. It's just dinner.

360
27:27.345 --> 27:29.705
Think of it as a group meeting.

361
27:32.705 --> 27:34.345
If you're worried about the gift,

362
27:34.425 --> 27:37.585
when you're free, we can get one together since I need one too.

363
27:38.825 --> 27:40.185
Forget it.

364
27:40.265 --> 27:41.305
This is our…

365
27:43.665 --> 27:46.665
This is our lab's first team-building activity.

366
27:50.185 --> 27:53.105
I think you should go along with…

367
27:57.465 --> 28:00.065
I think you should go along with everyone else.

368
28:00.825 --> 28:01.665
We'll see.

369
28:07.425 --> 28:09.945
Okay, tell me if you need anything.

370
28:21.345 --> 28:23.905
I thought coffee wasn't good for your health.

371
28:25.665 --> 28:26.905
Who says it's for me?

372
28:28.505 --> 28:29.785
Buckle up.

373
28:29.865 --> 28:31.505
Bi Dezheng is serious.

374
29:04.505 --> 29:06.065
What are you doing here?

375
29:06.145 --> 29:07.625
You've been standing here a while.

376
29:08.745 --> 29:10.265
Admiring the artwork.

377
29:13.105 --> 29:14.225
A culture medium?

378
29:15.065 --> 29:16.945
What did you draw?

379
29:22.865 --> 29:24.185
You.

380
29:30.425 --> 29:32.745
My drawing skills are not worse than Bi Dezheng's.

381
29:33.785 --> 29:35.665
Do you have to compete in this too?

382
29:40.745 --> 29:42.825
When I had a stiff neck,

383
29:42.905 --> 29:44.465
did I look like this?

384
29:46.825 --> 29:48.145
That's not it.

385
29:51.025 --> 29:52.465
You really don't remember?

386
29:59.505 --> 30:01.865
Who says I can't remember? I know it by heart!

387
30:13.825 --> 30:16.385
Sorry. I had a dream.

388
30:17.025 --> 30:19.785
If you keep going, you will burn out.

389
30:20.905 --> 30:23.345
Let's call it a day. Let's go.

390
30:34.025 --> 30:35.505
The lights don't work.

391
30:36.545 --> 30:39.465
Do the lights not work, or is something haunting us?

392
30:40.385 --> 30:41.225
What?

393
30:42.505 --> 30:44.905
I left my phone charging cable in the lab drawer.

394
30:45.945 --> 30:47.545
You scared me to death.

395
30:47.625 --> 30:50.105
Why didn't I ever notice this hallway was so dark?

396
30:51.185 --> 30:53.665
Maybe because you were never the last one to leave.

397
30:56.305 --> 30:57.985
Wait for me.

398
31:15.265 --> 31:16.545
Why did you pull me back?

399
31:35.185 --> 31:38.225
You're also scared but embarrassed to admit it. I get it.

400
31:40.705 --> 31:43.425
Yes, I'm scared. Scared to death.

401
31:44.105 --> 31:46.145
Then let's band together.

402
31:46.225 --> 31:48.025
I have a mission for you.

403
31:48.105 --> 31:50.385
Escort me safely to the restroom.

404
31:51.305 --> 31:53.265
I'm about to burst.

405
31:54.265 --> 31:56.145
Slowly. Not too fast.

406
32:31.665 --> 32:33.705
Want to go buy a gift together on Sunday?

407
32:37.025 --> 32:39.105
Aren't we supposed to prepare a small gift?

408
32:40.465 --> 32:41.385
You heard?

409
32:42.265 --> 32:44.785
Yes. It's like Shengyang said.

410
32:44.865 --> 32:47.265
No attendance and no gift would be inappropriate.

411
32:48.865 --> 32:50.265
Besides,

412
32:50.345 --> 32:51.425
I have to talk to you.

413
33:09.625 --> 33:11.025
Chen Yanzhou!

414
33:37.145 --> 33:39.385
What is this?

415
33:40.585 --> 33:43.905
What do you mean? I heard you in the restroom.

416
33:44.905 --> 33:48.225
I'm going to the boss's party too. How can you leave me out?

417
33:48.825 --> 33:51.265
Team building is important, don't you know that?

418
33:54.785 --> 33:57.825
You said you had to talk to me. What is it?

419
34:00.425 --> 34:01.985
No rush. Let's shop first.

420
34:04.105 --> 34:07.225
-Have you decided where to go? -No.

421
34:07.825 --> 34:09.985
You're lucky I came, you know that?

422
34:10.065 --> 34:12.264
You don't know the boss as well as I do.

423
34:12.905 --> 34:15.145
Our professor likes music.

424
34:15.225 --> 34:17.145
He has a record collection at home.

425
34:29.385 --> 34:30.705
How is this one?

426
34:33.304 --> 34:34.304
I think it's great!

427
34:53.264 --> 34:55.865
With this cover, even I would feel awkward giving it.

428
34:59.025 --> 35:00.665
Or we change our approach.

429
35:00.745 --> 35:03.385
I heard our boss has a daughter in kindergarten.

430
35:03.465 --> 35:04.345
He dotes on her.

431
35:04.425 --> 35:06.105
In my opinion,

432
35:06.185 --> 35:07.745
we could buy a stuffed animal.

433
35:08.505 --> 35:09.625
Let's go.

434
35:15.585 --> 35:16.865
Zheng Yu, do you think…

435
35:18.105 --> 35:20.065
A gift that's not for children's eyes?

436
35:20.145 --> 35:23.345
Do you think we'll ever graduate from the lab then?

437
35:23.425 --> 35:25.625
Listen to me. Put it down.

438
35:29.065 --> 35:31.665
Plan C is a set of books.

439
35:31.745 --> 35:34.585
It's unoriginal, but it's a safe bet.

440
35:42.505 --> 35:45.265
What are you doing? We said books. This way.

441
35:52.625 --> 35:55.425
None of those books were right for the boss.

442
35:56.545 --> 35:57.785
The store employee

443
35:57.865 --> 35:59.545
even recommended The Art of War.

444
36:00.145 --> 36:01.625
We already dance to his tune.

445
36:01.705 --> 36:03.225
He doesn't need war tactics.

446
36:09.225 --> 36:10.065
WU FA

447
36:10.145 --> 36:12.505
It has been a while. Where's the money?

448
36:18.425 --> 36:20.465
500 YUAN

449
36:20.545 --> 36:22.705
What's this? A handout?

450
36:32.265 --> 36:34.185
I know what to give!

451
36:35.825 --> 36:37.425
Professor, happy birthday.

452
36:37.505 --> 36:39.825
We wish you success. May you become an academician soon.

453
36:40.505 --> 36:41.505
Thank you.

454
36:42.105 --> 36:44.625
Okay, I accept your gift.

455
36:46.105 --> 36:48.265
Actually, the gift isn't what's important.

456
36:48.865 --> 36:52.105
I've read the progress report from the three of you.

457
36:52.185 --> 36:53.025
It's not bad.

458
36:54.265 --> 36:55.305
Shengyang.

459
36:57.705 --> 37:01.305
This is the first time I've heard such positive feedback from him.

460
37:08.065 --> 37:12.065
Today, although we are gathered under the guise of a birthday party,

461
37:12.825 --> 37:15.505
my intention was to help everyone relax

462
37:16.225 --> 37:19.665
so you are in better form when you dive into your studies and work.

463
37:20.945 --> 37:22.945
I will drink first.

464
37:23.025 --> 37:24.665
The rest of the time is yours.

465
37:24.745 --> 37:27.585
I have to get back to have dinner with my wife and child.

466
37:29.545 --> 37:31.025
How blessed.

467
37:36.905 --> 37:38.465
Have fun, everyone.

468
37:38.545 --> 37:39.585
Shengyang,

469
37:39.665 --> 37:41.025
settle the bill later.

470
37:41.105 --> 37:42.665
-Thank you, sir. -I'm leaving.

471
37:42.745 --> 37:44.465
-Sir, I'll walk you out. -No need.

472
37:44.545 --> 37:45.865
-Take care. -Bye.

473
37:45.945 --> 37:47.865
-Bye. -Take care. Bye.

474
37:50.345 --> 37:52.305
Drinks? I'll tell the waiter.

475
37:52.385 --> 37:54.105
-Write it in the chat. -Diet cola.

476
37:54.185 --> 37:56.545
I saw a store. I'll go buy a deck of cards.

477
37:56.625 --> 37:57.865
Xiaozhou, Kaka, log in.

478
37:57.945 --> 37:59.705
-Come on. -I was waiting for that.

479
38:04.265 --> 38:05.865
I thought you weren't coming.

480
38:05.945 --> 38:06.825
No way!

481
38:07.425 --> 38:09.105
We spent yesterday picking a gift.

482
38:10.265 --> 38:12.385
-You went shopping yesterday? -Yes.

483
38:12.465 --> 38:13.385
Zheng Yu went too?

484
38:13.465 --> 38:16.465
Of course. We're a team.

485
38:18.985 --> 38:20.745
-That's great. -Thank you.

486
38:25.905 --> 38:28.265
The waiter said the food will take a while.

487
38:28.345 --> 38:29.825
Why don't we play a game?

488
38:30.425 --> 38:31.425
What game?

489
38:31.505 --> 38:32.905
How about Fold a Finger?

490
38:33.665 --> 38:35.145
-Sure. -That's so boring.

491
38:36.185 --> 38:37.585
-Try it out. -Boring?

492
38:37.665 --> 38:39.825
-Let's play. Come on. -Yeah, try it out.

493
38:41.265 --> 38:42.465
Let me say this first.

494
38:42.545 --> 38:43.545
Whoever lies

495
38:43.625 --> 38:46.505
won't be able to publish a paper or graduate.

496
38:46.585 --> 38:48.265
-Sure! -That's cruel!

497
38:48.345 --> 38:49.185
I'll go first.

498
38:49.265 --> 38:51.505
Whoever hasn't spoken to the waiter,

499
38:51.585 --> 38:52.465
fold a finger.

500
38:53.145 --> 38:55.105
-Come on. -You're being ridiculous.

501
38:55.185 --> 38:58.185
Whoever didn't buy a deck of cards today, fold a finger.

502
38:58.785 --> 39:00.585
-That's cheating. -It's not just me.

503
39:00.665 --> 39:02.785
If that's how you play, it's no fun!

504
39:03.385 --> 39:04.905
-Exactly. -Then you show us.

505
39:05.505 --> 39:09.105
Whoever has a boyfriend or girlfriend, fold a finger.

506
39:18.985 --> 39:21.465
Buddy, you don't seem to know us very well.

507
39:21.545 --> 39:23.865
Everyone in our lab is single.

508
39:23.945 --> 39:25.905
No exceptions. That was lousy. Next!

509
39:25.985 --> 39:28.785
Since everyone is single, then…

510
39:29.585 --> 39:31.745
Whoever hasn't kissed this month,

511
39:31.825 --> 39:33.385
fold a finger!

512
39:33.985 --> 39:35.985
Come on, man.

513
39:36.065 --> 39:38.385
Aren't you just making fun of yourself too?

514
39:38.465 --> 39:39.945
Didn't you fold a finger?

515
39:40.825 --> 39:43.985
Wait, what's considered a kiss? Does kissing my cat count?

516
39:44.065 --> 39:46.025
You know, when I went home this month,

517
39:46.105 --> 39:47.825
I kissed my cat like crazy.

518
39:47.905 --> 39:49.865
-Does that even count? -That's no fun.

519
39:49.945 --> 39:52.625
-Isn't it? -Zhong Fangyi, you didn't fold a finger.

520
39:52.705 --> 39:55.145
I always give my mom a kiss goodbye.

521
39:55.225 --> 39:56.505
That's a stretch.

522
39:56.585 --> 39:57.585
Don't copy her!

523
39:57.665 --> 39:59.425
How old are you? You still do that?

524
39:59.505 --> 40:01.465
Why can't I?

525
40:01.545 --> 40:03.905
-Last night, you-- -I drank too much last night.

526
40:04.585 --> 40:07.345
I only remember Gao Xing mentioning a rumored boyfriend.

527
40:08.305 --> 40:09.585
That was hilarious.

528
40:10.465 --> 40:14.225
I… And then I don't remember much.

529
40:14.305 --> 40:15.985
Do you remember what you--

530
40:16.065 --> 40:17.945
Things ended so late yesterday.

531
40:18.025 --> 40:21.625
I'm already very grateful that you let me stay over.

532
40:21.705 --> 40:23.945
When I had a stiff neck,

533
40:24.025 --> 40:25.225
did I look like this?

534
40:25.305 --> 40:26.665
That's not it.

535
40:27.225 --> 40:28.505
You really don't remember?

536
40:28.585 --> 40:30.345
-This isn't fun. -Go to your cat.

537
40:31.505 --> 40:33.185
Zheng Yu.

538
40:33.265 --> 40:34.585
Is that folded or not?

539
40:40.425 --> 40:41.785
Folded.

540
40:46.145 --> 40:47.105
You're not folding?

541
40:50.585 --> 40:51.825
No.

542
40:59.825 --> 41:00.665
Fine.

543
41:00.745 --> 41:03.705
From the look of him, he doesn't plan to explain either.

544
41:03.785 --> 41:05.545
My turn now.

545
41:06.745 --> 41:08.025
Be honest.

546
41:08.585 --> 41:09.705
Come on.

547
41:24.025 --> 41:25.985
Can't take it, right? I win.

548
41:26.065 --> 41:27.545
-Not necessarily. -A straight.

549
41:27.625 --> 41:30.145
-You… -I have the lead.

550
41:30.225 --> 41:31.985
A pair of deuces! You lose!

551
41:32.065 --> 41:33.025
I lost again!

552
41:33.105 --> 41:34.185
Drink!

553
41:34.265 --> 41:35.705
-Drink! -Bottoms up!

554
41:35.785 --> 41:37.625
-Let's sing. -Come on.

555
41:37.705 --> 41:39.425
-I told you. -Zheng Yu, wine?

556
41:39.505 --> 41:40.585
I know, right?

557
41:42.745 --> 41:43.945
It's okay. It's for fun.

558
41:44.025 --> 41:45.185
I don't drink.

559
41:45.265 --> 41:47.185
Wise. Drinking leads to trouble.

560
41:47.265 --> 41:50.105
-This is good. It'll do. -Then I…

561
41:50.185 --> 41:52.065
-Add some more. -You guys pick too.

562
41:52.145 --> 41:53.385
Pick some too.

563
41:54.105 --> 41:56.145
Chen Yanzhou, where are you going?

564
41:56.225 --> 41:57.625
To get some air.

565
41:58.465 --> 41:59.425
There's more.

566
41:59.505 --> 42:00.905
Come on, then.

567
42:00.985 --> 42:02.465
Let's sing.

568
42:26.945 --> 42:30.305
Why aren't you drinking today? You even blacked out last time.

569
42:31.225 --> 42:33.905
That time was an accident.

570
42:35.825 --> 42:37.625
What about what happened afterward?

571
42:42.185 --> 42:44.225
You remember it all, right?

572
42:49.705 --> 42:53.065
Then you already guessed what I wanted to say to you yesterday.

573
42:54.745 --> 42:57.465
Later on, I guessed it.

574
43:00.545 --> 43:02.905
That's it? Nothing else?

575
43:16.105 --> 43:17.305
Okay.
